            "name": "Get vault APR and TVL",
            "description": {
              "content": "Returns calculated Annual Percentage Rate (APR) and Total Value Locked (TVL) for a specific vault, with enhanced APR breakdowns against ETH for rETH vaults. APR calculation adapts to vault maturity.",
